WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.112
A few numbers capture the impact.

00:00:02.192 --> 00:00:04.304
In Maze2D at context length five,

00:00:04.384 --> 00:00:10.216
the fine-tuned Uni-MASK models reach reward around
two point seven three on both behavior

00:00:10.296 --> 00:00:12.342
cloning and reward conditioning,

00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:18.320
compared to just one point one three and one point
four nine for the Decision Transformer,

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.036
and around one point five to one point seven for a
feedforward network.

00:00:23.116 --> 00:00:27.620
These results are averaged over five seeds and one
thousand rollouts.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.937
And critically, a single Uni-MASK model handles
behavior cloning,

00:00:32.017 --> 00:00:34.528
reward conditioning, dynamics modeling,

00:00:34.608 --> 00:00:37.650
and goal and waypoint conditioning all at once.
